plans.2e29c3bb4de12ee6621c2394e8a77618:
{"text":"Nothing written says whether Finance should trust the Norway numbers as a whole. The items written about Norway cover single metrics, and several of them flag reasons those numbers may not be comparable over time.

Orders in Norway have two conflicting rules: one says store credit and gift cards are left out [#r1.items.2.title], the other says they are counted [#r1.items.3.title]. Separately, online sales to Norway stopped on 4 August 2026, so orders there fell to almost nothing [#r1.items.4.title]. Returns changed definition on 28 April 2026, so earlier weeks read about 4 percent higher, and that item's check date has passed [#r1.items.5.title]. Units sold leaves out test accounts, and from 29 May 2026 the new app's test accounts are left out too [#r1.items.6.title]. Discount cost in Norway is lower for the months under the new VAT rule [#r1.items.0.title]. Return on ad spend has no paid campaign running since 9 May 2026, when the regulator paused price promotions [#r1.items.7.title].

Two of these are written as conflicting: the two Norway order rules above. Nothing written resolves between them.","calls":[]}

plans.505bbcce9e210028e66ad073063f4bbb:
{"text":"Two written rules in Heed disagree on whether net revenue in Spain includes VAT, so it is not settled from what is written. Both apply from 1 January 2026. One, owned by Sales, says net revenue in Spain includes VAT [itm_spainvatin], last checked on [#r1.items.0.checked.date]. The other, owned by Paid media, says it excludes VAT [itm_spainvatout], last checked on [#r1.items.1.checked.date]. Heed marks them as not conflicting with each other, and no owner has resolved which is right.

The metric's definition is gross sales after returns, discounts, VAT and payment fees, in euros, as finance reports it each month [@metric:net_revenue]. Sales owns the subject [@domain:area_sales], and Paid media owns the other rule [@domain:area_paid_media].

Before using the figure in a report, check which VAT treatment the report needs and confirm it with the Sales owners.","calls":[]}

